# API Documentation Standards

## Rule: Every Endpoint MUST have complete OpenAPI documentation

### Required Attributes for Each Endpoint

```csharp
.WithName("{ActionName}")              // Unique operation ID
.WithSummary("{Brief description}")   // Short human-readable description (≤120 chars)
.WithDescription("{Detailed description}")
.WithTags("{Category}")                // e.g. "System", "Definitions"
.Produces<{ResponseType}>(StatusCodes.Status200OK)
.ProducesProblem(StatusCodes.Status400BadRequest)   // when applicable
.ProducesProblem(StatusCodes.Status404NotFound)    // when applicable
.ProducesProblem(StatusCodes.Status500InternalServerError)
.AllowAnonymous()                      // OR .RequireAuthorization("policy")
.WithOpenApi(operation => { /* CorrelationId header */ return operation; })
```

### Error Response Format (RFC 7807 ProblemDetails)

```json
{
  "type": "https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc9110#section-15.5.5",
  "title": "Not Found",
  "status": 404,
  "detail": "The requested resource was not found",
  "instance": "/api/v1/unknown",
  "traceId": "00-..."
}
```

All error responses include `X-Correlation-Id` response header. Never expose stack traces or sensitive data.

### Response DTO XML Documentation

```csharp
/// <summary>Response payload description</summary>
/// <param name="Status">Field description</param>
public sealed record MyResponse(
    /// <summary>Field summary</summary>
    /// <example>Healthy</example>
    string Status
);
```

### CorrelationId Header

Document in every endpoint via `.WithOpenApi()`:

- Header: `X-Correlation-Id`
- Required: false
- Pattern: `^[a-zA-Z0-9\-._]+$`, max 128 chars
- Invalid/missing values → new GUID generated silently

### Standard OpenAPI Tags

| Tag | Purpose |
|-----|---------|
| `System` | Health, info, metrics |
| `Definitions` | Inquiry definition management |
| `Execution` | Inquiry execution |
| `Providers` | Provider configuration |
| `Callbacks` | Callback handling |
| `Audit` | Audit queries |
| `Admin` | Administrative operations |

### Checklist Before Marking Endpoint Complete

- [ ] `.WithName()` unique across all endpoints
- [ ] `.WithSummary()` under 120 characters
- [ ] `.WithTags()` uses standard tag
- [ ] Success response documented with `.Produces<T>()`
- [ ] Error responses documented with `.ProducesProblem()`
- [ ] Auth documented (`.AllowAnonymous()` or `.RequireAuthorization()`)
- [ ] DTOs have XML docs with `<summary>` and `<example>`
- [ ] CorrelationId header documented
- [ ] Markdown reference updated in `docs/API/`
